{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2023-05-25 09:00:00', 'title': 'EMERSON JOINS GREENTOWN LABS AS A TERAWATT PARTNER', 'text': "EMERSON'S COMPREHENSIVE AUTOMATION TECHNOLOGY AND SOFTWARE PORTFOLIO TO HELP CLIMATETECH STARTUPS COMMERCIALIZE AND SCALE INNOVATIONS SOMERVILLE, MASS. AND HOUSTON , MAY 25, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GREENTOWN LABS , THE LARGEST CLIMATETECH INCUBATOR IN NORTH AMERICA, TODAY ANNOUNCED EMERSON AS ITS NEWEST TERAWATT PARTNER—THE HIGHEST LEVEL OF ENGAGEMENT WITH THE INCUBATOR."}